// Example ~/.stignore for bsmith's Home-bsmith share (the whole home folder).
// The syncthing role installs <username>.stignore from this directory
// only when the user has no ~/.stignore yet; an existing one is never
// changed. The first matching pattern wins, so exceptions (!) go first.

// Dotfile whitelist
!/.bashrc
!/.profile
!/.gitconfig
!/.vim

// Ignore all dotfiles in the root folder, including Syncthing's own
// state in .local/state/syncthing (private key, config, database)
/.*

// Additional ignored root folders
/snap
/VMs
/Scratch
/Containers
